    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg",
        "imagegroup": "bg_20_G04_1/bg_20_G04_2",
        "solidwidth": "920/920",
        "solidheight": 720,
        "x": -720
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come to mention it, Missy, does this MC seem familiar to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Now that you say it, it's like I really have seen them somewhere before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm. I feel like I've seen her somewhere, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's D.D.D., you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "D.D.D.? Oh, now I remember. She's that real famous DJ, right? I saw a poster once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's she doing here as a presenter, huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm? Wait... Sideroca? What are you doing here? Out on a mission?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You could say that. It was a mission in Bol\u00edvar, helping Eyjafjalla with some geological research on the side. We heard there was a city here, and once we were all done, we put in for a vacation here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How about you? Came with Ch'en?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, we came for a different reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You seem pretty in the know. You a music girl too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not really. A lot of operators are into her, and I've learned some things by osmosis. Right, you want to come over and sit with us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sideroca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you say, Missy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. I was getting a little bored of the competition anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyjafjalla's here too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
